  "thig6.3:0.3": "<p><i>In <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn5.4'>SN 5:4</a>, a variation of the verse attributed to Māra, and the first verse attributed here to Sister Khemā, are included in a poem attributed to Sister Vijayā (see <a href='https://suttacentral.net/thig6.8'>Thig 6:8</a>). Sister Khema’s second verse is attributed to Sister Aḷavikā in <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn5.1'>SN 5:1</a>. Her third verse also appears in <a href='https://suttacentral.net/thig7.2'>Thig 7:2</a>; its first half, in <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn5.3'>SN 5:3</a>.</i></p>",
